        {"zh": "静静地享受阳光", "en": "Enjoying the sun quietly"},
        {"zh": "静静地在角落中休息", "en": "Resting quietly in a corner"},
        {"zh": "静静地等待着行动", "en": "Waiting quietly for action"},
        {"zh": "静静地守候着猎物", "en": "Waiting quietly for prey"},
